<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>mock-oidc debugger | Just a mock oauth2 client</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #fafafa; color: #222; margin: 0; }
        .container { max-width: 680px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        .card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e3e3e3; border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        h2 { margin-top: 0; }
        .docs-header { margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: #999; font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; }
        pre { background: #f4f4f4; border: 1px solid #e3e3e3; border-radius: 4px; padding: .75rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: .8rem; white-space: pre-wrap; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="card">
        <h2>OAuth2 Client Debugger</h2>
        <div class="docs-header">Something went wrong.</div>
        <p>Could be expired session? Please try again using the debugger form - <a href='{{.debugger_url}}'>{{.debugger_url}}</a></p>
        <label for="stacktrace">Stacktrace</label>
        <pre id="stacktrace"><code>{{.stacktrace}}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="docs-header">more debugging options</div>
        <p>More options will be added shortly</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
